
> blackrose@0.8.0 build:desktop
> node scripts/build-desktop.ts

BlackRose desktop shell (Tauri v2)
  ✓ core/blackrose.mjs staged (the whole app, one file)
  ✓ node/node.exe staged from C:\Program Files\nodejs\node.exe (self-contained shell)
  ✓ icons/icon.ico generated (16/32/48/256, procedural brand mark)
  ✓ node v24.21.0

  ✗ missing: Rust toolchain (cargo + rustc) — compiles the shell supervisor
    fix: install https://rustup.rs (rustup-init.exe), then reopen the terminal
  ✗ missing: MSVC Build Tools (link.exe) — rustc on Windows targets the MSVC linker
    fix: install "Visual Studio Build Tools" with the "Desktop development with C++" workload (visualstudio.microsoft.com/downloads)
  ✗ missing: @tauri-apps/cli — drives cargo + bundling
    fix: npm i -D @tauri-apps/cli

  fail-closed: the shell is fully scaffolded, but NO binary is built
  until the toolchain is complete (never ship unvalidated).
  after installing the missing pieces, re-run: npm run build:desktop
